cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Hoop Impact Bench, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Hoop Impact Bench (HIB): an open benchmark for NBA impact metrics"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-06"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://hoopimpactbench.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lumahoops/hoop-impact-bench"
abstract: >
  Hoop Impact Bench scores NBA player impact metrics on one question: do the values known before a season predict
  that season? Every metric is scored on the same regular-season games (2020-21 to 2025-26) under the same rules:
  game-margin R-squared, correlation with team win % (Krishna Narsu, 2024) and error against opponent-adjusted team
  margin (Taylor Snarr, 2020), centered so each metric's average team is 0, each also on rebuilt rosters, with
  bootstrap intervals and rank ranges. Two views: the full forecast (every player at the metric's own value) and
  established players (Snarr's 2020 rule: under 250 minutes the season before = -2.0). Bring a CSV of ratings and run
  one command.
authors:
